window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>A Vow of Ash and Bone</i> is a dark, unapologetic urban fantasy that thrusts you into a world where everyday loss and supernatural destiny collide. Vesper—a sharp-tongued psychologist and devoted mother—finds her life shattered when a seemingly ordinary new home reveals a hidden connection to a mysterious realm known as Nyxterra. As ghostly omens, ancient gods, bloodthirsty vampires, and fierce fae emerge from the shadows, Vesper is forced to confront the brutal truths of her past and the staggering power pulsing through her veins.</p> <p>Torn between protecting her children and embracing a destiny she never imagined, Vesper’s journey is as raw and relentless as it is fiercely captivating. When a dangerously magnetic stranger appears, offering both seduction and salvation, the stakes skyrocket. With biting humor, explicit language, and heart-pounding suspense, <i>A Vow of Ash and Bone</i> is a spellbinding tale for anyone who dares to stand against the darkness—and refuses to apologize for their fire. Prepare for a visceral ride through a realm where every choice burns with consequence and where the price of power is paid in ash and bone.</p>"; 
